# Generated files that have to round-trip byte-identically between a laptop
# and a Linux runner. The desktop bundles are compared against a fresh
# `pnpm build` (CI runs `git diff --exit-code`) and esbuild always writes LF,
# so a core.autocrlf checkout would otherwise hand the build a file it is
# bound to "change". The lockfile is pnpm's own output, checked by
# `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`.
*/desktop/plugin.tsx text eol=lf
*/desktop/plugin.js  text eol=lf
pnpm-lock.yaml       text eol=lf
